{"page":179,"verses":[{"verse_key":"8:17","surah":8,"ayah":17,"ar_uthmani":"فَلَمْ تَقْتُلُوهُمْ وَلَـٰكِنَّ ٱللَّهَ قَتَلَهُمْ ۚ وَمَا رَمَيْتَ إِذْ رَمَيْتَ وَلَـٰكِنَّ ٱللَّهَ رَمَىٰ ۚ وَلِيُبْلِىَ ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ مِنْهُ بَلَآءً حَسَنًا ۚ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ سَمِيعٌ عَلِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"It was not you who killed them but God, and when you [Prophet] threw [sand at them] it was not your throw [that defeated them] but God’s, to do the believers a favour: God is all seeing and all knowing-","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَلَمْ","en_gloss":"And not","transliteration":"falam","verse_key":"8:17"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تَقْتُلُوهُمْ","en_gloss":"you kill them","transliteration":"taqtulūhum","verse_key":"8:17"},{"pos":3,"ar":"وَلَـٰكِنَّ","en_gloss":"but","transliteration":"walākinna","verse_key":"8:17"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"8:17"},{"pos":5,"ar":"قَتَلَهُمْ ۚ","en_gloss":"killed them","transliteration":"qatalahum","verse_key":"8:17"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"And not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"8:17"},{"pos":7,"ar":"رَمَيْتَ","en_gloss":"you threw","transliteration":"ramayta","verse_key":"8:17"},{"pos":8,"ar":"إِذْ","en_gloss":"when","transliteration":"idh","verse_key":"8:17"},{"pos":9,"ar":"رَمَيْتَ","en_gloss":"you threw","transliteration":"ramayta","verse_key":"8:17"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَلَـٰكِنَّ","en_gloss":"but","transliteration":"walākinna","verse_key":"8:17"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"8:17"},{"pos":12,"ar":"رَمَىٰ ۚ","en_gloss":"threw","transliteration":"ramā","verse_key":"8:17"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَلِيُبْلِىَ","en_gloss":"and that He may test","transliteration":"waliyub'liya","verse_key":"8:17"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","en_gloss":"the believers","transliteration":"l-mu'minīna","verse_key":"8:17"},{"pos":15,"ar":"مِنْهُ","en_gloss":"from Him","transliteration":"min'hu","verse_key":"8:17"},{"pos":16,"ar":"بَلَآءً","en_gloss":